{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11等短停留段的纵向交替阅读不如X的左右分区顺手，扫读时更容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分区很利于快速扫读，叙述和感受也容易区分，但右侧感受有时只是把情绪并排列出，音乐变化与人物心理之间的联系不够充分。Y用【】突出每段心理落点，又通过感受的先后出现，把音乐细节、情绪变化和人物的内心转折串在一起，尤其是从怀念、犹疑、孤独到接受矛盾并继续生活的过程，能感受到细腻而连续的变化。虽然Y阅读负担稍大，但整体上更能让观众理解人物为什么这样想，也更能听出每段音乐具体在表达什么。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0e81f76b-a12b-4342-b163-64f9c6a6b7da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002251861612Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:23:48.563957+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8889c453c069dfd64807989c32e98947f8f6d3fbdedb7c006ba25530cd4803f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we